    "q-265744": {
      "dom_id": "step-q265744",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(w)=-3‖w{‖}^{2}-2\n$$\n\nthat maps a vector to a scalar, find ${∇}_{w}f.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the result \n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)=2w,\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}(-3‖w{‖}^{2}-2) \\\\  & =-3\\cdot {∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}^{2})-{∇}_{w}(2) \\\\  & =-3\\cdot {∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)-{∇}_{w}(2) \\\\  & =-3\\cdot 2w+0 \\\\  & =-6w.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
