    "q-275971": {
      "dom_id": "step-q275971",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(x,w)={w}^{T}x-4‖w{‖}^{2}-10\n$$\n\nthat maps two vectors to a scalar, find ${∇}_{w}f.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the results \n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)=x,\\,{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)=2w,\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x-4‖w{‖}^{2}-10) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)-4\\cdot {∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}^{2})-{∇}_{w}(10) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)-4\\cdot {∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)-{∇}_{w}(10) \\\\  & =x-4\\cdot 2w+0 \\\\  & =x-8w.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
