    "q-275973": {
      "dom_id": "step-q275973",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(w)=‖w{‖}_{1}-{w}^{T}w\n$$\n\nthat maps a vector to a scalar, find ${∇}_{w}f.$ You may assume that $w$ has all nonzero components.",
      "worked_solution": "Using the results\n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1})=\\text{sign}(w),\\,{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)=2w,\n$$\n\n we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1}-{w}^{T}w) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1})-{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w) \\\\  & =\\text{sign}(w)-2w.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-275973-a",
